<title>USA: Invivo signs three-year sales agreement.</title>
<headline>Invivo signs three-year sales agreement.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Invivo Corp on Tuesday said it has signed a three-year sales agreement with Purchase Connection, a health care purchasing group, for Invivo's patient monitoring products.</p>
<p>Purchase Connection's current membership includes 426 hospitals and 198 surgery centers in the United States.</p>
<p>Invivo shares were up 1 at 14-1/2 by midday.</p>
